            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Baking Nana"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is pretty much how we usually make our pork for tamales but then the pork is mixed with chili sauce, green chiles and cheese so the pork itself doesn't need to be highly seasoned. I question the amount of pork for 16 servings. Is this supposed to be 16 tamales? You might be able to get 16 tamales out of this 1 pound of meat but I doubt it. I usually do 10 lbs at a time. When we are making tamales we don't just make a few.",
            "datePublished": "2013-08-31T17:13:07.107Z"
